    "Links from other apps then come to Safira, and the Link picker asks which Profile receives each one, unless a Link rule decides. macOS asks you to confirm." : {
      "comment" : "Defaults: explanation of Make Safira the default browser",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Links from other apps then come to Safira, and the Link picker asks which Profile receives each one, unless a Link rule decides. macOS asks you to confirm."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les liens des autres apps arrivent alors dans Safira, et le sélecteur de liens demande quel profil reçoit chacun d’eux, sauf si une règle de lien en décide. macOS vous demande de confirmer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
